Rule Name: interfacear
Description: InterFACE AR (Unity 2022.3 + MRTK3) project rules for Cursor

## Project Overview
- Goal: Provide CPR training/simulation in a mixed reality (MR) environment (InterFACE AR)
- Engine/Version: Unity 2022.3.15f1 (`ProjectSettings/ProjectVersion.txt`)
- Main Frameworks: MRTK3, OpenXR, TextMesh Pro
- Core Code Location: `Assets/**/*.cs`, resource JSON under `Assets/Resources/**`

## Packages/Dependencies
- MRTK3: `org.mixedrealitytoolkit.*` (UX, Core, Input, etc.) — local tgz packages live under `Packages/MixedReality`
- OpenXR: `com.unity.xr.openxr`, `com.microsoft.mixedreality.openxr`
- Networking: REST (`UnityWebRequest`) + SSE (custom `EventSourceReader`), Socket.IO client present but not active in the main flow
- JSON Parser: `Assets/SimpleJSON.cs`
- Versions are authoritative in `Packages/manifest.json`

## Entry Scenes and Build (from WARP)
- Entry scenes (EditorBuildSettings):
  - `Assets/Scenes/main_scene.unity` (menu)
  - Doctor: `hmd_doctor_1..9`
  - Nurse: `hmd_nurse_1..5`

- Windows PowerShell helpers:

